{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048100/extras/e635d6ad621d8016eb937e84b3dca978.poster.avif?t=1774440781\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048100/extras/e635d6ad621d8016eb937e84b3dca978.webm?t=1774440781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048100/extras/e635d6ad621d8016eb937e84b3dca978.mp4?t=1774440781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Somewhere in the apocalypse, a fridge with a machete is defending the potato farm from the jungle. It's been a long day for everyone.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a colony with your human and robot survivors while a bioengineered jungle devours the world around you and rogue machines fight over what's left. Clear overgrowth, lay out buildings, grow food, wire up power, and fight hostile robots in turn-based tactical combat when they come for your settlement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The jungle grows in real-time, adapts to what gets built, and reclaims anything left undefended. A lush, green apocalypse that never stops pushing back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048100/extras/f0655868516de967b2a34a418be92ca4.poster.avif?t=1774440781\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048100/extras/f0655868516de967b2a34a418be92ca4.webm?t=1774440781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048100/extras/f0655868516de967b2a34a418be92ca4.mp4?t=1774440781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What you'll do:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and manage.</strong> Lay out settlements, grow crops, set up production chains from raw scrap to electrical components, wire energy grids, keep everyone fed and charged</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight in turn-based tactical combat.</strong> Position your squad, use cover, exploit terrain against rogue machines and worse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit robots.</strong> Capture hostile machines, reshape their programming, put them to work in the colony</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hold the line against the overgrowth.</strong> Clear growth, defend your perimeters, watch it adapt and come back</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reuse everything.</strong> Scrap metal becomes sheet metal becomes wiring becomes power infrastructure. Nothing new is being made, so nothing is trash</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your colony:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Preppers who build walls and keep the generators running. Techies who see network connections in the air. Naturists who walk through overgrowth that blocks everyone else. Robots carrying fifty years of fragmented memories who wandered in from the wilderness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robots need charging stations and spare parts. Humans need food, sleep, and the occasional drink. Everyone has opinions about how things should be done.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048100/extras/fa98e211112df0ee984ccdb420148b0a.poster.avif?t=1774440781\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048100/extras/fa98e211112df0ee984ccdb420148b0a.webm?t=1774440781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048100/extras/fa98e211112df0ee984ccdb420148b0a.mp4?t=1774440781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A world built by survivors</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Agency is an independent studio founded in 2025.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4048100?t=1774440781","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048100/e2d00f72fa3d9e3a10372d98fb76904edb48acbc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774440781","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048100/018a59ba11e480186d585b4391a683685d725efa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774440781","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048100/018a59ba11e480186d585b4391a683685d725efa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774440781","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048100/extras/e635d6ad621d8016eb937e84b3dca978.poster.avif?t=1774440781\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048100/extras/e635d6ad621d8016eb937e84b3dca978.webm?t=1774440781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048100/extras/e635d6ad621d8016eb937e84b3dca978.mp4?t=1774440781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Somewhere in the apocalypse, a fridge with a machete is defending the potato farm from the jungle. It's been a long day for everyone.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a colony with your human and robot survivors while a bioengineered jungle devours the world ar